      <Desc>STRONGMINDS IS A SOCIAL ENTERPRISE THAT RADICALLY EXPANDS MENTAL HEALTHCARE FOR PEOPLE WITH DEPRESSION GLOBALLY.OUR PROVEN, COST-EFFECTIVE MODEL IS BASED ON GROUP INTERPERSONAL PSYCHOTHERAPY, WHICH WE PROVIDE FREE OF CHARGE.SINCE OUR FOUNDING IN 2013, WE HAVE EMBARKED ON INNOVATIVE APPROACHES TO DELIVER THIS THERAPY MODEL AT SCALE. IN 2024 WE TREATED 426,642 PEOPLE WITH DEPRESSION IN UGANDA, ZAMBIA, KENYA, NIGERIA, AND ETHIOPIA. AT THE END OF 2024, WE CEASED A PILOT PROJECT TO TEST OUR MODEL IN THE UNITED STATES.</Desc>
